+<item>
+<title>Telegram macOS</title>
+<description>New:&lt;br&gt;• Dictator answers @mentions in Guest Mode on the Mac: it reads the chat it was summoned in and describes its photos, and when a question needs your own data it asks you privately first; the answer is shown to you before anything is posted&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Less memory while scrolling chats full of photos: off-screen photos are handed back to the system within seconds&lt;br&gt;• No memory spike a minute after launch on accounts with many media files&lt;br&gt;• Photos in the media viewer open with less work and keep wide-gamut colours&lt;br&gt;• The agent asks before it changes its own computer or sends data out after reading other people's messages or web pages, and web approvals show the exact address&lt;br&gt;</description>
+<pubDate>2026-19-11 04:39:38</pubDate>
