-<title>Telegram macOS</title>
-<description>New:&lt;br&gt;• Answer the agent's confirmations from the Dictator bot with buttons; while the bot is asking, no alert appears on the Mac&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improved:&lt;br&gt;• More videos play at once with less memory, and opening chats full of videos no longer wastes CPU on retries&lt;br&gt;• Call audio recovers smoothly from problems in its sandboxed decoder and uses less CPU in group calls&lt;br&gt;• Widget animations run at the full display rate, and hidden widgets no longer render&lt;br&gt;• The first contact card opens faster, and the document services use less memory&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• Animations and stickers could stop for a minute after their service restarted&lt;br&gt;• Large SVG previews could use hundreds of megabytes of memory&lt;br&gt;• Markdown files lost the text inside HTML blocks&lt;br&gt;• The chat list could freeze while Settings loaded bot icons&lt;br&gt;• Lockdown Mode's rules were shown while it was off&lt;br&gt;</description>
